abstract: >
  A reproducible machine learning framework for forecasting regional household
  electricity consumption in Saudi Arabia. The repository includes benchmark
  experiments, Saudi regional case studies, baseline forecasting models,
  advanced machine learning methods, and a hybrid forecasting framework
  designed for transparent and reproducible research.

